With traditional Servlet:

Browser
   ↓
Tomcat
   ↓
Servlet
   ↓
JSP
----------------------------------------------------------
With Spring MVC:

Browser
   ↓
Tomcat
   ↓
DispatcherServlet
   ↓
Controller
   ↓
Service
   ↓
Repository
   ↓
Database
-----------------------------------------------------------
Spring MVC introduces a central Servlet called:

DispatcherServlet

You don't normally write this Servlet yourself.

Spring Boot configures it for you.
